[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2882.55, "timestamp": "00:48:02", "text": "好的。就像我胡说八道的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2884.55, "timestamp": "00:48:04", "text": "现在。我也遇到过这种情况。你知道，这就是生活。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2886.87, "timestamp": "00:48:06", "text": "我也遇到过这种情况，好像根本就没反应似的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2895.349, "timestamp": "00:48:15", "text": "知道？是的。你最近怎么样？告诉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2896.55, "timestamp": "00:48:16", "text": "让我了解你。就像你正在做这件事一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2898.79, "timestamp": "00:48:18", "text": "杰森，今天是第83天了。就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2901.349, "timestamp": "00:48:21", "text": "就像差不多三个三个那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2902.63, "timestamp": "00:48:22", "text": "应该要三个月吧？那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2905.43, "timestamp": "00:48:25", "text": "流畅播放。情况如何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2907.75, "timestamp": "00:48:27", "text": "哦，那已经是……呃，那已经是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2911.03, "timestamp": "00:48:31", "text": "某物。我还在想我怎么样"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2912.464, "timestamp": "00:48:32", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "zenu attach your mic on your glasses"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2920.23, "timestamp": "00:48:40", "text": "它一定是，它一定是，嗯，它一定是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2921.095, "timestamp": "00:48:41", "author": "@notSojasu", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/9iC0_w5nBHNC4BhGgiYeUdW6ZfCOGIbrmqCvaFZ2PV9zycbIf4HhyAZJDeqpX-v3fXW6q93S=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "not only can she not hear but life takes away her talking privileges as well"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2923.99, "timestamp": "00:48:43", "text": "非常……怎么说呢……是不是很累？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2926.71, "timestamp": "00:48:46", "text": "嗯，从生理角度来说，我不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2928.95, "timestamp": "00:48:48", "text": "照顾好自己。我吃不下饭"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2931.27, "timestamp": "